<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese shorter bonds buoyed by prices data.</title>
<headline>Portuguese shorter bonds buoyed by prices data.</headline>
<text>
<p>1650 GMT - Portuguese shorter bonds were lifted by good March prices data, which paved way for possible rate cut. *June 97 futures down 0.19 points to 107.20 *Feb 97 cash 98.87 (98.75), yld 6.78 vs 6.80 cls *Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash 09 bps vs -7 bps</p>
</text>
